  "story": {
    "day": 101,
    "title": "Kaya's Busy Day",
    "sentences": [
      "Kaya, a junior high school student, felt excited.",
      "Her favorite subject was social studies.",
      "They learned Spanish about South Korea and Bali, Indonesia.",
      "She used her pen to write notes about them.",
      "On the fifteenth, she was ready for a Christmas sale.",
      "She rode the central bus to a museum on the fourth floor.",
      "She saw an orange fish and picked up a roast salad.",
      "These were for her hungry baseball teammate.",
      "He needed ninety yen for iced tea and bread.",
      "After a clean shower, she took a bath.",
      "She would bathe a twelve-year-old dog and swim.",
      "\"A police officer doesn't like that band's song, which is theirs to spend, else,\" an interviewer asked about a witch or god."
    ]
  }
